---
title: "House Finesse Calendar"
description: "Who is on House Finesse every Friday, and how to follow the schedule in your own calendar."
layout: "page"
redirectFrom: "/calendar"
linkText: "Calendar"
---

{#
  The grid is built from the public House Finesse Google Calendar feed (see src/_data/schedule.js).
  If the feed can't be loaded at build time, schedule.available is false and the page falls back to
  the Google Calendar embed below.
#}
{% if schedule.available %}
<p class="hf-schedule-intro">A new House Finesse lands every Friday morning. Here is who is behind the decks for the rest of the year.</p>
<p class="hf-schedule-intro">Follow it in your own calendar: <a href="{{ schedule.webcalUrl }}">Apple Calendar, Outlook and others</a> or <a href="{{ schedule.addUrl }}">Google Calendar</a>.</p>

<div class="hf-schedule">
{% for month in schedule.months %}
  <section class="hf-month" aria-labelledby="month-{{ month.key }}">
    <h2 class="hf-month__title" id="month-{{ month.key }}">{{ month.name }} {{ month.year }}</h2>

    <div class="hf-grid" role="table" aria-label="{{ month.name }} {{ month.year }} releases">
      <div class="hf-grid__head" role="row">
        {% for weekday in ["Thu", "Fri", "Sat", "Sun"] %}
        <div class="hf-grid__weekday{% if weekday == 'Fri' %} hf-grid__weekday--release{% endif %}" role="columnheader">{{ weekday }}</div>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>

      {% for week in month.weeks %}
      <div class="hf-grid__week" role="row">
        {% for cell in week.cells %}
        {% set episode = cell.episode %}
        <div class="hf-cell{% if cell.isRelease %} hf-cell--release{% endif %}" role="cell">
          <span class="hf-cell__date">
            <span class="hf-cell__weekday">{{ cell.weekday }}</span>
            {{ cell.day }}{% if cell.monthLabel %} {{ cell.monthLabel }}{% endif %}
          </span>
          {% if episode %}
            {% set episodeUrl = "" %}
            {% for post in collections.posts %}
              {% if post.date | formatDate("yyyy-LL-dd") == cell.iso %}
                {% set episodeUrl = post.url %}
              {% endif %}
            {% endfor %}
            {% if episodeUrl %}
              <a class="hf-cell__title" href="{{ episodeUrl }}">{{ episode.title }}</a>
              <span class="hf-cell__status">Out now</span>
            {% else %}
              <span class="hf-cell__title">{{ episode.title }}</span>
              {% if episode.tbc %}<span class="hf-cell__status">DJ to be confirmed</span>{% endif %}
            {% endif %}
          {% endif %}
        </div>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>
{% endfor %}
</div>
{% else %}
<p>This is the upcoming schedule of your upcoming podcast episodes, easy to follow in your own personal calendars if you prefer.</p>

<iframe src="https://calendar.google.com/calendar/embed?height=600&wkst=1&ctz=Europe%2FLondon&bgcolor=%23D81B60&showPrint=0&showTabs=0&showCalendars=0&mode=AGENDA&hl=en_GB&title=House%20Finesse%20Schedule&src=YmM1MTVlY2ZmYzFhOWVhZmFlZTVjYmFlOWVlZGU5NGY5Y2RlN2FkNmZjODU4YTQ2YTk0ZGRkNDU0NDdmYzM2MEBncm91cC5jYWxlbmRhci5nb29nbGUuY29t&color=%23E4C441" style="border-width:0" width="800" height="600" frameborder="0" scrolling="no"></iframe>
{% endif %}
